msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san? It's me, Shibayama, the guy who asked you to\r\n"
"help collect that loan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Oh, hey. What's going on?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"I'm getting reports of a drunk guy hanging out around the\r\n"
"entrance to Pink Street."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "This guy sounds like Motoyama."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"Sorry for the trouble, but could you head over there\r\n"
"and check it out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Got it, I'll head over to Pink Street."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"Yeah, thanks. I'll give you ten percent as a reward if you\r\n"
"can collect that loan."
msgstr ""

